# astrion-skill v1
goal: Count words and characters in the clipboard
trigger:
  - phrase: "word count"
  - phrase: "how many words"
  - phrase: "count words"
do: |
  Read the clipboard. Count words (split on whitespace, drop empty
  strings), characters (with + without spaces), and sentences
  (split on .!?). Show all four counts in a notification. If
  clipboard is empty, prompt "Copy text first."
constraints:
  level: L1
  budget_tokens: 120
  reversibility: FREE
